{"schemaVersion":1,"id":98,"sections":[{"id":"130001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20711],"start":0,"count":52},{"id":"130001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20712],"start":52,"count":11},{"id":"130002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[20713],"start":63,"count":15},{"id":"130002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[20714],"start":78,"count":18},{"id":"130003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[20715],"start":96,"count":22},{"id":"130003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[20716],"start":118,"count":18}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:1","scriptId":20711,"text":"距离死水受到上位旅行者泰莱塔袭击过去了大半年。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:2","scriptId":20711,"text":"死水基地的修缮工作也已经顺利完成，恢复了往日的面貌。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1037,"speaker":"莉莉娜·卢卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:3","scriptId":20711,"text":"“哈啊……芮蓓姐姐，今天也没什么工作呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:4","scriptId":20711,"text":"“今天是周末，多数的队伍都在修整，娜娜莉的队长伊迪丝不也在修整吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1037,"speaker":"莉莉娜·卢卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:5","scriptId":20711,"text":"“也是呢，在宿舍里闲得无聊就来前台看看，结果这里也没什么人呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:6","scriptId":20711,"text":"“不过等会儿华尔兹中队会来这里呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1037,"speaker":"莉莉娜·卢卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:7","scriptId":20711,"text":"“华尔兹中队！？就是和旅行者战斗的死水英雄！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:8","scriptId":20711,"text":"“是啊，今天他们会来总部，有特殊的任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1037,"speaker":"莉莉娜·卢卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:9","scriptId":20711,"text":"“哇喔……特殊任务，听上去好神秘。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:10","scriptId":20711,"text":"“你看，说曹操曹操到，他们来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":11,"right":1037,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:12","scriptId":20711,"text":"一席红衣的指挥官带领着他的钢舞姬们来到了芮蓓所在的任务前台。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:13","scriptId":20711,"text":"“芮蓓，今天又是波西娅的委托？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:14","scriptId":20711,"text":"“没错，上次任务的费用已经汇入了您的死水卡里。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:15","scriptId":20711,"text":"“那可真是太及时了，这个月出了点意外，手头已经相当拘谨了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:16","scriptId":20711,"text":"“您快去吧，别让波西娅博士久等了，我已经通知过她了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:17","scriptId":20711,"text":"“还真是一如既往的效率，那我们先走了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:20","scriptId":20711,"text":"“太慢了，都下午了，怎么现在才来。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:21","scriptId":20711,"text":"“还好吧，我们可是刚从任务回来就跑到你这儿了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:22","scriptId":20711,"text":"“你这身行头……是不是很久没正常睡觉了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:23","scriptId":20711,"text":"“这也是工作的一部分，自从兰布达消失以后，我的工作量可就没人分担了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:24","scriptId":20711,"text":"“好吧，言归正传，这次又是什么棘手的任务？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:25","scriptId":20711,"text":"波西娅从桌上的一堆文件中抽出了一个文件夹。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:26","scriptId":20711,"text":"“最近艾坪森林出现了新品种的战车兽，一般的攻击武器好像无法击穿它们的装甲。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:27","scriptId":20711,"text":"“根据这照片，好像是蝎子类的昆虫战车兽呢，不过照片有点糊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:28","scriptId":20711,"text":"“嗯，能有照片已经不错了，这可是侦查队拼死拍到的照片。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:29","scriptId":20711,"text":"“不过我的中队现在人不齐啊，这任务恐怕难以胜任……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:30","scriptId":20711,"text":"“我知道，部分队员的舞装需要大修和升级是吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:31","scriptId":20711,"text":"“是的，光是佩妮她们可能会有点战力不足。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:32","scriptId":20711,"text":"“这个我会想点办法，总之你们先去准备下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:33","scriptId":20711,"text":"“好吧，艾坪森林啊……过去可需要不少时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1192,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:34","scriptId":20711,"text":"“专用的运输机已经给你们准备好了，少啰嗦，快点去准备。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:35","scriptId":20711,"text":"“唉……知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1192,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:38","scriptId":20711,"text":"使用波西娅的专用运输机抵达了艾坪森林。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:39","scriptId":20711,"text":"“我的天……这里真的是艾坪森林！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:40","scriptId":20711,"text":"“是的，这个森林在战车兽肆虐的时候发生过变异，现在各种菌菇密布。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:41","scriptId":20711,"text":"“简直是童话王国才会有的景象呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":1188,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:42","scriptId":20711,"text":"“非常巨大的蘑菇，可能会出现有毒的孢子，长官要小心。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":1188,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:43","scriptId":20711,"text":"“嗯，我们这次来的人并不多，不搞出大动静的话应该没事。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:44","scriptId":20711,"text":"由于佐伊等人要对舞装进行深度维修，所以本次任务只带了佩妮，奈特莉和芙琳。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:45","scriptId":20711,"text":"佩妮所用的是由波西娅改装后的新舞装，火力大幅提升。而奈特莉则细心地在平时就准备了一套备用舞装，性能与原舞装差异并不大。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:46","scriptId":20711,"text":"“这次任务我们人数不多，所以一旦出了什么问题，优先考虑怎么逃跑。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:47","scriptId":20711,"text":"“了解，波西娅给的这套舞装也需要一些适应时间，战斗不是最优先事项。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:48","scriptId":20711,"text":"好在只是短期的侦查任务，所以小队并没有特别准备太多的行李和补给。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:49","scriptId":20711,"text":"吉普车行驶在泥泞的山道上，由于真菌的野蛮生长，原本的道路变得非常崎岖。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:50","scriptId":20711,"text":"“这里以前是皇家公园吧，森林里偶尔能看到一些陈旧的皇室摆设呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:51","scriptId":20711,"text":"“是的，不过战车兽入住这里之后，整片森林就成了三不管地带。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:52","scriptId":20711,"text":"“连生态环境都发生了变化，战车兽对这里的影响也太大了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:53","scriptId":20711,"text":"一行人来到了发现新品种战车兽的目击地点。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:54","scriptId":20711,"text":"“那边那只不就是新品种战车兽吗？和照片上的外观一模一样，是只大蝎子呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":1188,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:55","scriptId":20711,"text":"“仔细观察就知道了，只是像蝎子，这东西也许压根不是节肢动物。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":1188,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:56","scriptId":20711,"text":"“好了，别闲聊了，开始任务，击杀或者捕获，你们看着办。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-PROLOGUE:20711:57","scriptId":20711,"text":"“周围还有零星几只战车兽，一起收拾了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:0","scriptId":20712,"text":"和波西娅的报告几乎一样，钢舞姬的武器对它很难造成伤害。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:1","scriptId":20712,"text":"“周边的其他战车兽都已经清理干净，就剩那家伙了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:2","scriptId":20712,"text":"“这蝎子的甲壳对炮弹的耐性非常高，只有打中关节的缝隙才能造成有效的伤害。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:3","scriptId":20712,"text":"“好在它的攻击欲望并不高，只要拖入持久战，胜利肯定属于我们的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:4","scriptId":20712,"text":"“最好不要那么肯定，我有不好的预感。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:5","scriptId":20712,"text":"芙琳话音刚落，就看到蘑菇林的另一侧，探出了几只蝎子战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:6","scriptId":20712,"text":"“芙琳，你的直觉也太准了吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:7","scriptId":20712,"text":"“谢谢长官夸奖。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:8","scriptId":20712,"text":"“我可没夸你……算了，回收战线，把那个蝎子单独引出来。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:9","scriptId":20712,"text":"可惜事与愿违，另外几只蝎子也凑了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130001-EPILOGUE:20712:10","scriptId":20712,"text":"“撤，撤，撤，被它们追上可不是闹着玩的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:1","scriptId":20713,"text":"没想到几只新品种的蝎子就把整个小队逼到了这种狼狈的地步。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:2","scriptId":20713,"text":"虽然钢舞姬的火炮对这些战车兽有震慑作用，但充其量只能减慢它们追赶的速度。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:3","scriptId":20713,"text":"眼看着终于要甩掉蝎子了，但火炮声吸引来了另一群飞虫战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:4","scriptId":20713,"text":"“长官，不太妙，这群飞虫战车兽也有能弹开炮弹的特性！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:5","scriptId":20713,"text":"“什么！？真是见了鬼，波西娅可没说还有其他新品种啊！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:6","scriptId":20713,"text":"“总之先溜吧，被追上可就不好玩了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:7","scriptId":20713,"text":"然而吉普车在这崎岖的蘑菇林中很难达到令人满意的速度……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:8","scriptId":20713,"text":"眼看就要被追上了——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:11","scriptId":20713,"text":"“还以为是什么情况呢，这不是死水的大红人么？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1190,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:12","scriptId":20713,"text":"“果然，我并没有看错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1191,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:13","scriptId":20713,"text":"“丹尼斯的眼力很强嘛，那么远都能看到。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:14","scriptId":20713,"text":"“诶！？是伊莎贝尔教官……你们怎么在这里？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:15","scriptId":20713,"text":"“那当然和你们的目的一样，是来处理那些嵌合战车兽的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:16","scriptId":20713,"text":"“嵌合战车兽？难道是那些蝎子？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-PROLOGUE:20713:17","scriptId":20713,"text":"“先不解释了，那些家伙马上要追上来了，准备迎击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:0","scriptId":20714,"text":"在伊莎贝尔教官和她的两名学生的支援下，成功干掉了来犯的嵌合战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:1","scriptId":20714,"text":"“很强啊，竟然把让我们陷入苦战的战车兽就这么轻松得干掉了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1190,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:2","scriptId":20714,"text":"“不不不，这已经是我们第三次来这里了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1191,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:3","scriptId":20714,"text":"“前几次遇到它们的时候，我们也吃了不少苦头……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:4","scriptId":20714,"text":"“哦？那些蝎子和飞虫吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:5","scriptId":20714,"text":"“嗯，这种东西被我们称之为嵌合战车兽，因为它们的甲壳和一般的战车兽不一样。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1190,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:6","scriptId":20714,"text":"“我们手里的武器已经改良了好几次了，这次的针刺弹就是对付它们的大杀器。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:7","scriptId":20714,"text":"“桑赫斯特的动作还挺快。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:8","scriptId":20714,"text":"“不不不，刚才只是消灭了飞虫部分，只要蝎身的部分还在，它们还会复活。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:9","scriptId":20714,"text":"“什么！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:10","scriptId":20714,"text":"根据伊莎贝尔的说法，这些嵌合兽是前一段时间才出现的新品种战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:11","scriptId":20714,"text":"它拥有两个身体，形似蝎子的部分被称为地嵌蝎，而另一个部分则是可以飞行的天嵌虫。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:12","scriptId":20714,"text":"如果不能同时消灭两个身体，它们就会复活，而时间判定的间隔只有半小时。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:13","scriptId":20714,"text":"这才是嵌合战车兽最棘手的地方。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:14","scriptId":20714,"text":"“要同时消灭是吧，这种特性确实比一般的战车兽要麻烦不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:15","scriptId":20714,"text":"“一般天嵌虫是负责侦查，而地嵌蝎负责守护繁殖地盘，要同时消灭比较困难。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:16","scriptId":20714,"text":"“那给我们一些针刺弹，一起进行围剿？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130002-EPILOGUE:20714:17","scriptId":20714,"text":"“今天先修整一下吧，明天可以试试，但别抱太大期望。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:1","scriptId":20715,"text":"在伊莎贝尔的临时营地中休息了一晚。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:2","scriptId":20715,"text":"第二天——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:3","scriptId":20715,"text":"“进入营地前，先给你们一份地图，上面标记了我们布置的路障和雷区。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:4","scriptId":20715,"text":"“竟然还有雷区！？还好没误闯进去……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:5","scriptId":20715,"text":"“那里有竖牌子，人类看得懂，战车兽可看不懂，当然不长眼的就没办法了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:6","scriptId":20715,"text":"“那这次要利用雷区来排除地嵌蝎？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:7","scriptId":20715,"text":"“没错，我们密集排布了针刺地雷，只要吸引它们进入，保证它们有来无回。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:8","scriptId":20715,"text":"“可以，我们主要负责吸引地嵌蝎，飞虫就交给你们。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:9","scriptId":20715,"text":"“那就按规划的路线展开作战，只要消灭了其中的一环就发信号弹，开始计时。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:10","scriptId":20715,"text":"于是双方立刻展开行动——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:11","scriptId":20715,"text":"但没想到的是，事情发生了意外……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:12","scriptId":20715,"text":"在侦查地嵌蝎的时候，众人看到了惊人的一幕。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:13","scriptId":20715,"text":"“我没看错吧？那两种战车兽怎么合体了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:14","scriptId":20715,"text":"“如果我没猜错的话……这难道是在修复？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:15","scriptId":20715,"text":"之前被伊莎贝尔她们击杀的天嵌虫真从地嵌蝎的尾巴上长出来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:16","scriptId":20715,"text":"由于画面过分诡异，不禁让人联想起之前旅行者所奴役的骸虫……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:17","scriptId":20715,"text":"“这东西不会是骸虫吧……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1188,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:18","scriptId":20715,"text":"“是有这种可能，但周围并没发现旅行者，昨天的闹得挺凶的，如果有旅行者应该早就现身了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1188,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:19","scriptId":20715,"text":"“嗯……但现在这个样子要怎么办呢？已经和计划发生了很大的偏差。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:20","scriptId":20715,"text":"“总之先采用原定战术把它们引到雷区吧，既然有地嵌蝎说明它们还能踩雷。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:21","scriptId":20715,"text":"“了解，那就按计划执行，小队散开，准备引诱目标。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-PROLOGUE:20715:22","scriptId":20715,"text":"于是作战正式展开。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:1","scriptId":20716,"text":"按照原定计划将目标群体引入了雷区，很快大量的地雷爆炸，率先冲入雷区的嵌合战车兽纷纷殒命。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:2","scriptId":20716,"text":"“很好，而且目标因为是嵌合状态，所以直接死亡了，真是太顺利了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:3","scriptId":20716,"text":"不过随着其中一只嵌合兽殒命时发出的奇怪叫声，事态立刻就恶化了……雷区再也没听到过爆炸声……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:4","scriptId":20716,"text":"“这……不是吧……那些嵌合兽竟然在贴地飞行！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1187,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:5","scriptId":20716,"text":"“是天嵌虫！它们把地嵌蝎的身体强行拉着一起在飞！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:6","scriptId":20716,"text":"“这下麻烦了！发射信号弹！得让伊莎贝尔她们知道！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:9","scriptId":20716,"text":"还没等信号弹发射，几枚飞弹就已经击中了正在飞行的嵌合兽，落入雷区后又发生了二次爆炸。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1187,"section":5,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:10","scriptId":20716,"text":"“我们那边连个飞嵌虫的影子都没有，果然是发生了意外啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1190,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:11","scriptId":20716,"text":"“不过还不算晚，现在全力击杀飞行的嵌合兽就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1190,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1191,"speaker":"奥菲利亚·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:12","scriptId":20716,"text":"“没错！别让它们飞出雷区！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:13","scriptId":20716,"text":"“我还以为还能再撑会儿呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1191,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:14","scriptId":20716,"text":"“五十分，对情况把握不充分，与原定计划不同的时候就该通知我们了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:15","scriptId":20716,"text":"“是……我的错……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:16","scriptId":20716,"text":"“好在我们这边反应更快，不然让它们飞出雷区就麻烦了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:17","scriptId":20716,"text":"在伊莎贝尔小队的配合下，终于将所有的嵌合战车兽都收拾了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:18","scriptId":20716,"text":"“不容易，这下何止是鳞片样本了，完整的尸体都能运回去了，波西娅应该会高兴吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1189,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:19","scriptId":20716,"text":"“嗯，没想到你们会来，这次剿灭行动空前成功，你们的精彩表现我会转告维多利亚的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"130003-EPILOGUE:20716:20","scriptId":20716,"text":"“好的，我们也没想到任务可以那么快达成，这下可以回去多休几天假了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-18.webp","left":4,"right":1189,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
